#: includes/admin/views/overview.php:78
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Job Manager needs both BuddyPress and WP Job Manager to be "
"active. Activate them to use the profile job and resume features."
msgstr ""
"BuddyPress Job Manager ha bisogno che sia BuddyPress che WP Job Manager "
"siano attivi. Attivali per utilizzare le funzioni del profilo dei lavori e "
"dei curriculum."

